cff-version: 1.2.0
title: OSINT Sources & Disinformation Watchlist
message: If you use these datasets, please cite them as below.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: Leapfrog-LSA
    alias: LAWARA AI
repository-code: "https://github.com/Leapfrog-LSA/osint-sources-disinfo-watchlist"
abstract: >-
  Two companion datasets for open-source intelligence and due-diligence
  work. Fonti_OSINT is a curated catalogue of 5,040 reliable, ongoing
  sources across media, open data, corporate registries, sanctions and
  PEP lists, cybersecurity intelligence and other domains, annotated with
  language, geographic scope, access type and RSS feed where available.
  disinfo_sources_master is a watchlist of 114 documented disinformation
  domains, covering the Russian state-linked Doppelganger impersonation
  clones and Italian fake-news and typo-squat networks, each recorded
  with its attribution, documenting source and level of evidence.
keywords:
  - OSINT
  - disinformation
  - fact-checking
  - threat-intelligence
  - open-data
  - media-literacy
  - source-reliability
  - due-diligence
license: CC-BY-4.0
version: 0.4.0
date-released: "2026-08-01"
